Changelog::kv
Players can get turned around in the dungeon and need
to rotate their map.

Update:
-------

Added a context menu action to rotate everything 90 degrees.  It doesn't really
work with hexagons, but you can't expect rotation by 90 to work on hexagons.
The more proper things would be to rotate by 60, but many object types assume
axis aligned.

Another alternative would actually be to apply a transform on the context, but
then text would be the wrong way. No silver bullet.
